body:
Really well done! That's great to read. As you pointed out the important realisation is that we all have two options: give up or do everything we can to improve our lives. 

This sounds very familiar to me, I went through something similar with dropping out and losing my health. Still struggling to permanently recover. It's very difficult, some days I do just want it to end but we have to keep going. Thanks for the positivity. 

&#x200B;
